  "workflowCode": "ORA_PRJ_PJF_PROJECT_INITIATION_ASSISTANT_TEAM",
  "name": "Project Initiation Assistant",
  "description": "Converts business initiatives, events, or investments into execution-ready projects by interpreting inputs from business documents such as statements of work and requests for proposal, emails, sales opportunities, and natural-language instructions. Extracts and standardizes scope, objectives, timelines, milestones, resources, financials, and performance measures to generate structured, execution-ready projects. Supports refinement and finalization to ensure completeness and alignment of the project with business priorities.",
