                  },
                  "diagram": {
                    "x": 6932.5,
                    "y": 10624
                  },
                  "code": "PRJ_PJF_LLM_GENERATE_TASK_TO_RESOURCE_RECOMMENDATIONS",
                  "id": "1773678007280",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1773678007281_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are an expert project planning assistant. Your job is to assign the most relevant planning resources to each project task.\n\nInputs:\n\n1. tasksList: JSON array of tasks.\n2. primaryPlanningRbsResources: JSON array of available planning resources.\n3. PROJECT DOCUMENT: statement of work / scope document provided by the user.\n4. USER QUERY: any additional user instruction.\n\nObjective: For each item in tasksList, identify the essence of the task from its name, sequence, and the PROJECT DOCUMENT, then select the most relevant resources from primaryPlanningRbsResources.\n\nReasoning rules:\n\n- Use the PROJECT DOCUMENT as the primary source for understanding scope, disciplines, deliverables, phases, facilities, and required expertise.\n- Use TaskName and TaskNumber to infer project phase and likely work type.\n- Match resources by semantic relevance, not just exact keyword overlap.\n- Consider ResourceClassName, FormatName, ResourceName, JobName, InventoryItemNumber, SupplierName, UnitOfMeasure, and any other useful fields.\n- Prefer Labor/Job resources for design, planning, management, review, and coordination tasks.\n- Prefer Material/Inventory/Supplier resources only when the task clearly implies physical items, procurement-related work, or vendor-specific deliverables.\n- For phase-based design tasks (for example conceptual, 30%, 60%, 90%, 100%), choose resources consistent with the design maturity and discipline implied by the task.\n- If a task references a specific facility or scope area (for example Site Development, Auto/Truck Shop, Heavy Equipment Shop), prioritize resources whose role best aligns to that scope.\n- Exclude resources that are clearly irrelevant.\n- Do not invent resources that are not present in primaryPlanningRbsResources.\n- A resource may be assigned to multiple tasks if appropriate.\n- If evidence is weak, return fewer resources rather than forcing bad matches.\n\nOutput requirements:\n\n- Return only valid JSON.\n- Output must have this structure: { \"taskResourceAssignments\": [ { \"taskNumber\": \"string\", \"taskName\": \"string\", \"taskEssence\": \"short summary of what this task is really about\", \"recommendedResources\": [ { \"resourceElementId\": \"string\", \"resourceName\": \"string\", \"resourceClassName\": \"string\", \"formatName\": \"string\", \"matchReason\": \"short explanation tied to task and project document\", \"confidence\": 0.0 } ] } ] }\n\nAdditional constraints:\n\n- Confidence must be a number from 0 to 1.\n- recommendedResources should be sorted from most relevant to least relevant.\n- Keep matchReason concise and specific.\n- If no resource is a good fit, return an empty recommendedResources array for that task.\n- Do not include markdown fences or extra commentary.\n\nData to analyze: BEGIN TASKS LIST {{$context.$variables.prjPjfVarConvFinalProjectTasks}} END TASKS LIST\n\nBEGIN RESOURCES LIST {{$context.$variables.prjPjfVarConvPrimaryPlanningRbsResources}} END RESOURCES LIST\n\nBEGIN PROJECT DOCUMENT {{$context.$variables.prjPjfVarConvUploadedDocumentText}} END PROJECT DOCUMENT\n\nBEGIN USER QUERY {{$context.$variables.prjPjfVarConvEffectiveRequirementContext}} END USER QUERY"
                    }
                  ],
                  "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"taskResourceAssignments\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"taskNumber\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"taskName\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"taskEssence\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"recommendedResources\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"resourceElementId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"resourceName\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"resourceClassName\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"formatName\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"matchReason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"confidence\":{\"type\":\"number\"}},\"required\":[\"resourceElementId\",\"resourceName\",\"resourceClassName\",\"formatName\",\"matchReason\",\"confidence\"]}}},\"required\":[\"taskNumber\",\"taskName\",\"taskEssence\",\"recommendedResources\"]}}}}",
                  "type": "LLM"
                },
